+
+/*
+ * These are the PRID's for when 23:16 == PRID_COMP_INGENIC
+ * 31:24, Company Options is reserved;
+ * 23:16, Company ID is 0xd0;
+ * 15:8,  Processor ID;
+ *              -- 15:13, is the Generation of INGENIC's core.
+ *                              0x0 is XBurst1,
+ *                              0x1 is XBurst2,
+ *                              others are reserved.
+ *              -- 12:8, the encode of micro-architecture(uA).
