+/**
+ * Return the chanspec bandwidth in MHz
+ * Bandwidth of 160 MHz will be returned for 80+80MHz chanspecs.
+ *
+ * @param	chspec		chanspec_t
+ *
+ * @return	bandwidth of chspec in MHz units
